## Signature Color: Warm Solaris

You said you like warm solaris tones. Here's what I'll use:

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--accent` | `#e8915a` | Primary accent — links, highlights, active states |
| `--accent-light` | `#f4b88a` | Subtle tints — hover backgrounds, borders |
| `--accent-dark` | `#c97040` | Text on light backgrounds, emphasis |
| `--accent-glow` | `#e8915a20` | Very subtle background washes |

This is a warm copper-amber — like a sunset or aged paper. It'll pair beautifully with your neutral palette and give the site warmth without overwhelming the editorial feel.

**Where it'll appear:**
- Selection highlight (text you highlight on the page)
- Active nav underline
- Skill proficiency dots (filled ones)
- Timeline dots on hover
- Section dividers (subtle)
- Links and hover states
- Scrollbar thumb
- Avatar placeholder background
- The "explore more" links at the bottom

